<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50/1.00 up - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50/1.00 up - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 higher. Demand good. Top $61.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  59.50-60.50, few 61.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  58.50-59.50</p>
<p>Sows: Under 500 lbs. steady to 1.00 higher, over 500 lbs. steady to 1.00 lower. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs.  45.00-48.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  47.00-49.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  48.00-50.00, few 51.00</p>
</text>
